1300 BM$="Man: Forgive me for bothering you when you're so busy. My name is\Connors. I'm the man who sent you that letter.":GOSUB 5100
1310 BM$="Connors handed him his business card and took a seat.":GOSUB 5100
1320 BM$="The business card read `Nick Connors`, reporter for the weekly gossip\magazine `Flash`.":GOSUB 5100
1330 BM$="Connors: I'm a celebrity reporter, but I like to think I'm a bit of a detective.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1340 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Get to the point. How does a reporter from Flash know about the\Devil King? If you're just here to write some crappy article I'm leaving.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1350 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Connors: Please, wait. You came here because of the letter, right? I was\told about the Devil King by someone. This could be the scoop of the year\if I can write about it.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1360 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: My dreams, a scoop? I don't know anything about the Devil King\myself. Are you going to peek into my dreams or something?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1370 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Connors: Ah, so he appears in your dreams... I didn't know that. The\information I was sent seemed like occult fiction, I wasn't sure what to do\with it... But I'm starting to think it might have been all true.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1380 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: So you didn't know about my dreams... What kind of information do\you have? Tell me. If it's not made up, you can write your article about it.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1390 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Connors: I wasn't sure what to make of it, that's why I wanted to confirm\your side of the story.":GOSUB 5100
1400 BM$="Connors: A certain person contacted me for an interview. I'm unable to\disclose their identity, but I will say that they were in no position to lie.":GOSUB 5100
1410 BM$="Connors: This person told me about how the `Devil King` was possessing\you, using his powers to plant the seed of evil in your audience.":GOSUB 5100
1420 BM$="Connors: He said that your audience, under the influence of that demon,\would then commit murder, lose their mind, and die shortly after...\Connors: It may well be that your consciousness is strong enough to keep":GOSUB 5100:BM$="the Devil King's power under control, but...":GOSUB 5100
1430 BM$="Connors: When the star of darkness, from the edge of the universe,\approaches the Earth, your consciousness will be replaced by that of the\Devil King, and something terrible will happen. They said that the star of":GOSUB 5100:BM$="darkness will reach us in twelve days.":GOSUB 5100
1440 BM$="Connors: They wanted to reveal this information themselves, but they\feared your fans would take it as a personal attack against you, that's\why they contacted me.":GOSUB 5100
1450 BM$="Connors: If I publish this article and nothing happens in twelve days, I'd\lose my place in the entertainment business. But this person is a big deal.\They have too much to lose.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1460 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Are you for real? You called me here to dump this load of crap on\me? I have no words to express my disgust. Bah... If you want to write about\it, go ahead, I don't care.":GOSUB 5100
1470 BM$="David: I hope your editor's a horror fan, or he sure won't be happy when\he reads your article. You've got balls to call yourself a reporter.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1480 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Connors: Please don't misunderstand, I'm not trying to ruin your\reputation here. I'm actually a fan of yours. That person said that\publishing this article would save your life.":GOSUB 5100
1490 BM$="Connors: They also said that you should keep your distance from your\manager, Susanna. They said she's a dark sorceress, who wants to turn\you into the Devil King...":GOSUB 5100
1500 BM$="Connors: It seems she used her sorcery to cause the accident that killed\Ms. Claire, your former manager, in order to approach you. Does that ring\any bells?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1510 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: This conversation is over. Yeah right! I'm the Devil King, Susanna is a\sorceress... What's next? Is Alan a werewolf? Maybe Andrew's a vampire.\Come on, aren't you gonna tell me Martin's a demon?!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1520 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Connors: I'm only trying to get as much information I can, like that person\asked me to. I'll contact you again once I've written my article.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1530 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I think you should contact a good shrink first. Get some help. I'm\leaving. Unlike SOME people, I'm actually busy.":GOSUB 5100
1540 COMMON FO:BM$="David was upset for having wasted his time. If he told Susanna about this,\she'd probably storm into Flash's office and give them a piece of her mind.":GOSUB 5100
1545 GOSUB 9020:'
1550 GOSUB 6150:BM$="When he returned to his room, he found Susanna waiting for him inside.":GOSUB 5100
