1700 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: David! Where have you been? I came to help you tidy up the room,\but it looks like you're already done.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1710 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I got up early, so I went out for lunch. No point in staying here. Let's\go to my apartment.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1720 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Finally. We've been staying in hotels for so long. I've never been\to your apartment... This is exciting!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1730 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: The excitement will die down the moment you look around my room... I\haven't cleaned up in ages. This is all the luggage I have. Let's go.":GOSUB 5100
1740 GOSUB 6120:BM$="After checking out at the front desk, they took a cab to David's\apartment.":GOSUB 5100
1750 GOSUB 6130:GOSUB 6310:BM$="When she entered David's flat... Susanna shrieked in panic, rushing to open\the window. Dirty dishes were piled up in the sink. You could barely see the\living room table under the empty bottles and cans.":GOSUB 5100
1760 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I-I can finally breathe... I MUST clean this up. Where do I even\start...? For now let's make some space for you to sit down...":GOSUB 5100
1770 BM$="Susanna started tidying up the apartment, at times shrieking, but she\seemed to be enjoying herself. Once she was done, she went to a nearby\supermarket to get what she needed to make dinner.":GOSUB 5100
1780 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David thought back to what Connors told him.":GOSUB 5100
1790 BM$="`I never told anyone about my dreams... How could anyone know about the\Devil King? It's all so absurd... Too absurd to just be some kind of\harassment. I should talk to Susanna about this...`":GOSUB 5100
1800 BM$="David could not talk about it with anyone else. Susanna knew about his\nightmare. She would listen to him seriously.":GOSUB 5100
1810 BM$="Susanna came back with a big bag of groceries. David wanted to bring up\the subject, but Susanna was happily humming while cooking. He did not\want to spoil the mood.":GOSUB 5100
